  "title": "Peraso (PRSO) and Virewirx Achieve Milestone in Drone Communication Technology",
  "summary": "Peraso Inc PRSO and Virewirx announced a successful demonstration of a simulated environment for drone wireless communication, achieving a peak data capacity exceeding 50Gbps. This milestone underscores the collaborative efforts of both companies, with Peraso contributing its innovative 60 GHz wireless semiconductor solutions and Virewirx providing its VX60 High-Performance Wireless Network.",
